t 2.png", "id": "4492670527670916", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307433_4492670531004249_3892191243148672188_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mnWcv9tUNXMQ7kNvwG3Byx3&_nc_oc=Adpik5iPPOoP2MqW8hcEMxj7OYZNNvXRMO8W7WX_h0xNeStZ5PcIhlU0ybRb57BwpkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-kdFr9p9z5MUvswbwhgfScpHr2P0Qh3CCUxQ-K_ZPn5w&oe=6A468745"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 3.png", "id": "2030520227679685", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820887_2030520231013018_5579373603812150964_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sNQJn67RqyAQ7kNvwH2dCes&_nc_oc=AdrOJpN7Nt-NrgA2bn7IQLd9dbOmqcpDvQIt80Zf9l0ZWKSzZ_XBIr8gLQlsqjcLFpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af92b332B4g7p5adIPZv8pY8q19_V97nCwvjuQdFNBq7gA&oe=6A466930"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hero Cover - Landscape.png", "id": "4582158552045108", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_4582158555378441_1009529458867220250_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EPBWh4mevxoQ7kNvwF5tDlC&_nc_oc=AdrtZvCp-u6aZ8ZWokcr4jB8bV6-L37i9-O9RfpwOav6Hh42om_MjMcCm1QZjW_QBVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9xM4bDGugqkFbTfYVFnc3-08c2TrZc6xSjjl0LlJU7hA&oe=6A466FBF"}, "display_name": "Sign'n'Sync", "keywords": ["handtracking", "mixedreality", "rhythm", "music", "controllerfree"], "long_description": "Experience the next evolution of **Quest Hand Tracking**. Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a high-energy rhythm experience where your hands are the controller. Forget the buttons\u2014use 4 intuitive hand signs to interact with a digital world that glitches, pulses, and dissolves to the beat.\n\n### **CURRENT FEATURES**\n\n*   **Pure Hand Tracking:** Built from the ground up for a controller-free experience.\n    \n*   **Glitch-Dissolve Aesthetic:** Watch the environment react to your performance with unique real-time shaders.\n    \n*   **Two High-Energy Tracks:** Glitch-Pop Energy & Afro-Electronic Groove.\n        \n*   **Studio Mode:** Perfect for seated or standing play in any environment.\n    \n\n### **HOW TO PLAY**\n\nAs the rhythmic gates approach, match the 4 specific hand signs to the beat. Precision is key\u2014the better your timing, higher the score.\n\n### **ROADMAP**\n\nSign\u2019n\u2019Sync is a living project. We are starting with our core \"Studio Mode\" to ensure the Hand Tracking feels perfect. Coming soon in future updates:\n\n*   **\"Sync me to da Club\":** Transform your actual room into a reactive venue using Spatial Data.\n    \n*   **Expanded Setlist:** More tracks ranging from Lo-Fi to Hardcore Electronic.\n    \n*   **Complex Signs:** New gestures to master as the BPM rises.\n    \n\n**Sync up. Sign on. Start the beat.**", "short_description": "Sync your hands. Master the rhythm. Welcome to Sign\u2019n\u2019Sync. Experience the next level of Quest hand-tracking with a unique glitch-dissolve aesthetic. \n\nUse 4 intuitive signs to interact with a digital landscape that pulses to the beat of high-energy electronic tracks. Launching with two energetic launch tracks (128 & 140 BPM). \n\nController-free, immersive, and built for the flow. More tracks and 'Club Mode' coming soon!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/signsync-privacypolicy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Love", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/digital-love-landing-page/contact-us", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_co